{"operations":[{"content":"# Core hours\n\nCore working hours are from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026[[cite:obs-3019ad1999a71f2c7ef7e467cbe37b454cb50786 \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]].\n\nWhere the board resolution of 15 September 2026 and the staff handbook differ, the resolution applies[[cite:obs-3019ad1999a71f2c7ef7e467cbe37b454cb50786 \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"f2026d83240933ca5028e2f8315988b79f661f60630e374d3a1d88ba5e04b9c6","kind":"modify","path":"doc/hours.md"}],"rationale":"Removed the statement quoting the staff handbook hours (10:00 to 16:00) as it contradicts the board resolution and is forbidden. Kept only the board resolution hours and the statement that the resolution applies when there is a difference, both supported by the resolution source."}